  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n, m\xE0n ngh\u1EC9: \u0111\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i hai c\xE1nh
    tay \u0111\xF2n \u0111\xE3 th\u1EA5y \u1EDF 33, di chuy\u1EC3n ng\u1EAFn r\u1ED3i
    c\xF9ng ra s\xE2n r\u1ED9ng; kh\xF4ng th\xEAm h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng. B\u1ED1
    tr\xED: P18 \u2014 gi\u1EEF h\xE0nh vi c\u1EE7a 33, gi\u1EA3m qu\xE3ng di chuy\u1EC3n
    v\xE0 b\u1ECF l\u1ED1i ra h\u1EB9p; hai s\xE2n tho\xE1t nh\xECn th\u1EA5y c\xF9ng
    l\xFAc.\nRecovery: Hai bi \u1EDF c\xE1c m\xE1ng k\xEDn b\xEAn; ch\u01B0a y\xEAu
    c\u1EA7u r\xFAt c\u1EA3 hai qua c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 h\u1EB9p ngay sau khi n\xE2ng"
